<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on June 1.</title>
<headline>Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on June 1.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat figures for domestic grain stocks on June 1 in tonnes, followed by figures for a month earlier and a year earlier:</p>
<p> Bread wheat    3,752,655	 4,406,135	 3,063,883</p>
<p> Maize	    4,853,711	 5,130,049	 3,285,853</p>
<p> Sorghum	    381,113	   404,191	   305,190</p>
<p> Barley	     161,311	   181,358	   198,597</p>
</text>
